d self-reported dental problems in relation to pregnancy</article-title><source>Am J Public Health</source><year>2004</year><volume>94</volume><fpage>765</fpage><lpage>771</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15117698</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dinas</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Achyropoulos</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Hatzipantelis</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Marromatidis</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Zepiridis</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Theodoridis</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Dovas</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Tantanasis</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Goutzioulis</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Bontis</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pregnancy and oral health: utilisation of dental services during pregnancy in northern Greece</article-title><source>Acta Obstetricia et Gynecologica</source><year>2007</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>938</fpage><lpage>944</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17653878</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1080/00016340701371413</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hirsh</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Clarke</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Has small-scale audio-visual dental health education a viable future?</article-title><source>Community Dent Oral Epidemiol</source><year>1977</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>160</fpage><lpage>163</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">70320</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1600-0528.1977.tb01632.x</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>